# Android (mobile/) — signing material and build outputs. The keystore and its
# passwords must never be committed; losing the keystore means losing the ability
# to update the app on the Play Store. mobile/keystore/ holds them outside the
# android/ project because expo prebuild wipes unrecognized files there.
mobile/keystore/
mobile/android/keystore.properties
mobile/android/app/release.keystore
mobile/android/local.properties
release-cf/dist/
mobile/out/
public/release/*.apk

# Firebase mobile config — regenerated per environment from the Firebase console.
# Not a secret (the API key is public by design; the Firestore rules are the
# security boundary), but kept out of the repo so a fork cannot target this project.
mobile/google-services.json
